group features/gui
note The Diff tab lists every path added (+), removed (-) or changed (~) against the parent revision's map (@- in jj, HEAD in git), with a summary of what changed and, for changed paths, a line per new or changed step. Clicking a row opens that path in the document; a removed path, which exists only in the parent, is described in the status bar instead. 'refresh' reads the parent's map again, for when the parent revision moved.

